WEBVTT

00:00:08.305 --> 00:00:13.105
. hack//Legend of the Twilight

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:22.905
Tell me
nanimo wakaranai no demo
Tell me
I don't understand anything, but

00:00:23.085 --> 00:00:30.085
You say itsumo sonna kotoba mo
You always say those
kinds of words, too

00:00:31.025 --> 00:00:37.825
Surechigau dake no
You find another way
You find another way where
we only pass each other by

00:00:38.305 --> 00:00:44.935
Owatteku sekai wo tobidashite
You know?
And rush out into a world
that's ending, you know?

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:50.805
Hello Hello
It's a New World
Hello, hello,
it's a New World!

00:00:51.085 --> 00:00:54.485
Hikari yori hayaku
Faster than light,

00:00:55.255 --> 00:00:59.315
monokuro no supiido de
with monochromatic speed

00:00:59.585 --> 00:01:05.115
Hello Hello
It's a New World
Hello, hello,
it's a New World!

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:08.885
Jikan yori tooku
Farther than time,

00:01:09.695 --> 00:01:14.465
kakenukeru
You're so far away
I run through it; you're so far away

00:01:30.055 --> 00:01:34.685
Kite's Bracelet

00:01:46.365 --> 00:01:48.595
Move that tree a little
more to the right.

00:01:49.105 --> 00:01:50.505
It's difficult to see the tree behind it.

00:01:50.605 --> 00:01:51.765
Yes sir.

00:01:55.175 --> 00:01:58.515
Yes, that's fine. Please continue.

00:01:58.915 --> 00:01:59.975
Okay.

00:02:02.785 --> 00:02:03.945
Is that you, Reki?

00:02:04.385 --> 00:02:05.445
Yes.

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:08.145
This is regarding your
encounter with the...

00:02:08.525 --> 00:02:10.385
...Shogun from the other
day, Lord Balmung.

00:02:11.495 --> 00:02:13.985
There was no record of it in
the system management log.

00:02:14.595 --> 00:02:18.555
An Armored Super Shogun has
never appeared in that area.

00:02:21.205 --> 00:02:22.295
Is that so?

00:02:30.815 --> 00:02:33.835
Then, what did I fight?

00:02:37.115 --> 00:02:37.885
Lord Balmung?

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:40.525
Please continue with the investigation.

00:02:40.985 --> 00:02:42.145
Those guys in...

00:02:42.755 --> 00:02:45.225
...system management are
professionals at managing data.

00:02:45.625 --> 00:02:46.755
Yes.

00:02:50.465 --> 00:02:51.595
This event will...

00:02:52.135 --> 00:02:55.265
...be the best managed of
the ones I have a hand in.

00:02:55.775 --> 00:02:57.535
You say that every time.

00:02:58.475 --> 00:02:58.735
Hm?

00:03:08.785 --> 00:03:10.585
Huh? You're back?

00:03:11.755 --> 00:03:14.185
I was on the road and just stopped by.

00:03:14.655 --> 00:03:16.025
I'm returning to the office now.

00:03:17.355 --> 00:03:19.255
I don't know if I'll be home tonight.

00:03:19.695 --> 00:03:21.685
Just do what you want for dinner.

00:03:23.735 --> 00:03:24.965
Later then.

00:03:31.805 --> 00:03:33.835
All right! Let's get going.

00:03:45.825 --> 00:03:47.085
Where is she?

00:03:49.125 --> 00:03:50.525
Shugo!

00:03:51.225 --> 00:03:52.365
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:03:52.365 --> 00:03:53.525
You're late!

00:03:53.865 --> 00:03:56.765
L-late? I'm not THAT late... huh?!

00:04:02.335 --> 00:04:03.535
You're that...

00:04:04.035 --> 00:04:07.405
The Rare Hunter of Love
and Courage, Mireille!

00:04:07.805 --> 00:04:09.745
Hey, hey. Where are you going today?

00:04:09.915 --> 00:04:12.315
Can I come with you? Can I?

00:04:12.745 --> 00:04:14.045
W-where? We haven't...

00:04:14.145 --> 00:04:16.415
Then shall I be your guide?

00:04:17.715 --> 00:04:19.385
Speed Charm!

00:04:25.895 --> 00:04:28.455
That's mean of you to use that here!!!

00:04:36.375 --> 00:04:39.465
Well, it turns out that
I've been burned before.

00:04:39.775 --> 00:04:40.905
You've been burned?

00:04:41.105 --> 00:04:43.405
Was it really that terrible?

00:04:43.875 --> 00:04:46.845
No, that's not it at all.

00:04:47.215 --> 00:04:49.915
Hm... How to say it?

00:04:50.785 --> 00:04:52.585
Please, just say whatever you like.

00:04:52.655 --> 00:04:53.885
Looks like we lost her.

00:04:55.855 --> 00:04:58.795
I wouldn't mind going with her.

00:04:59.125 --> 00:05:02.255
I want to play "The
World" with you, Shugo...

00:05:02.465 --> 00:05:03.555
...not her!

00:05:05.405 --> 00:05:08.465
Hey, Rena. What's that?

00:05:08.775 --> 00:05:10.235
It's an event notice.

00:05:10.305 --> 00:05:11.965
Whenever there is an event...

00:05:12.275 --> 00:05:13.765
...that's how it's advertised.

00:05:14.275 --> 00:05:15.575
I haven't a clue.

00:05:15.875 --> 00:05:17.745
It's for a flower-viewing event.

00:05:18.145 --> 00:05:19.305
You can read it?

00:05:19.345 --> 00:05:20.005
Of course!

00:05:20.885 --> 00:05:21.645
Heroes, gather...

00:05:21.955 --> 00:05:24.615
...at the area, "Voluptuous
Cherry Maze"!

00:05:24.985 --> 00:05:27.825
I look forward to the blooming
of glorious blossoms.

00:05:28.355 --> 00:05:30.015
What does that mean?

00:05:30.395 --> 00:05:33.025
In other words, go to
the indicated area...

00:05:33.165 --> 00:05:35.785
...and make the flowers bloom.

00:05:36.195 --> 00:05:40.155
If you clear the event,
you get some rare item.

00:05:40.435 --> 00:05:42.425
Wow. Sounds fun.

00:05:42.535 --> 00:05:43.065
Want to go?

00:05:43.475 --> 00:05:44.875
Can anyone enter?

00:05:45.345 --> 00:05:46.465
Of course!

00:05:46.645 --> 00:05:49.445
Let's go then, to the
"Voluptuous Cherry Maze"...

00:05:50.815 --> 00:05:51.935
What's wrong?

00:05:52.015 --> 00:05:55.955
Various skills are required
to clear an event.

00:05:56.315 --> 00:05:59.375
It'll be difficult without a
Wavemaster in the party.

00:06:00.055 --> 00:06:01.425
Wavemaster?

00:06:03.795 --> 00:06:05.765
I'm a Wavemaster.

00:06:07.765 --> 00:06:10.525
May I be of any help?

00:06:11.195 --> 00:06:12.355
Lucky!

00:06:24.815 --> 00:06:27.375
This is "Voluptuous Cherry Maze"?

00:06:27.985 --> 00:06:30.955
It's not blooming at all!

00:06:31.055 --> 00:06:33.145
This is an event to make them bloom!

00:06:35.095 --> 00:06:37.285
Cherry blossoms?

00:06:41.935 --> 00:06:44.425
Well then, to start with "Repth".

00:06:49.675 --> 00:06:52.265
Nothing's happening, huh?

00:06:53.545 --> 00:06:55.945
Next! Pha Repth!

00:07:00.845 --> 00:07:03.375
Perhaps recovery spells won't work?

00:07:04.955 --> 00:07:05.515
That's it!

00:07:05.985 --> 00:07:08.685
You have to give flowers
water to make them bloom!

00:07:09.025 --> 00:07:10.015
Water?

00:07:11.525 --> 00:07:12.955
Rue Rom!

00:07:24.275 --> 00:07:25.795
I guess that wasn't it either.

00:07:26.445 --> 00:07:28.035
Hey you!

00:07:30.115 --> 00:07:32.775
You didn't need to get
us soaking wet as well!

00:07:34.015 --> 00:07:36.715
Maybe we need some kind of item.

00:07:36.885 --> 00:07:38.145
I'll go look!

00:07:38.485 --> 00:07:40.615
Ah... Hey!!!

00:07:43.195 --> 00:07:45.655
My costume's all ruined.

00:07:45.925 --> 00:07:48.195
Such a breath takingly...

00:07:48.365 --> 00:07:49.485
...fine girl.

00:07:55.375 --> 00:07:57.565
Breath taking...

00:07:59.305 --> 00:07:59.865
What?

00:08:00.845 --> 00:08:02.205
It's nothing.

00:08:13.825 --> 00:08:16.085
Sake to quench the thirst...

00:08:16.355 --> 00:08:20.095
...what is still lacking is the flowers.

00:08:20.095 --> 00:08:21.285
Lord Balmung.

00:08:22.295 --> 00:08:24.525
What are you doing in a place like this?

00:08:24.965 --> 00:08:26.195
The event's started.

00:08:27.265 --> 00:08:30.105
Oh dear, you wrote data for sake?

00:08:30.375 --> 00:08:32.345
You can't get drunk off of it you know?

00:08:32.605 --> 00:08:34.475
Don't say that. This is "refined".

00:08:35.015 --> 00:08:35.905
Yes. Yes.

00:08:36.215 --> 00:08:39.185
Obviously, I have no
sense of "refinement".

00:08:40.115 --> 00:08:42.085
So, about that matter?

00:08:42.355 --> 00:08:43.335
It's still undergoing investigation.

00:08:43.885 --> 00:08:45.585
Given who it is we're dealing with,

00:08:45.925 --> 00:08:47.415
it may take some time.

00:08:49.655 --> 00:08:52.025
It seems that no one
has cleared it yet.

00:08:52.495 --> 00:08:56.455
How wretched.
The beautiful sake sheds tears.

00:08:57.095 --> 00:08:58.825
Perhaps it was too difficult?

00:08:59.535 --> 00:09:00.835
It's common sense.

00:09:09.015 --> 00:09:10.175
Those two.

00:09:15.315 --> 00:09:16.445
Cherry blossoms.

00:09:17.655 --> 00:09:20.675
We used to go see them a lot.

00:09:31.335 --> 00:09:34.465
Shugo! Rena! Let's eat.

00:09:34.665 --> 00:09:36.035
Or we'll eat it first.

00:09:37.175 --> 00:09:38.865
No! No way!

00:09:39.305 --> 00:09:40.835
We won't let you!

00:09:44.775 --> 00:09:46.175
It was fun.

00:09:50.855 --> 00:09:52.585
I wonder.

00:09:53.285 --> 00:09:57.285
If fallen cherry blossoms
can be brought back?

00:09:58.395 --> 00:09:59.555
Shugo...

00:10:00.065 --> 00:10:02.055
...we should look for a way...

00:10:02.165 --> 00:10:03.135
...to make the flowers bloom.

00:10:03.565 --> 00:10:05.085
Huh? Oh yeah.

00:10:12.645 --> 00:10:15.265
Rena! It's a dog - a big doggie!

00:10:16.075 --> 00:10:20.945
Give me your paw! Down. Again.

00:10:23.655 --> 00:10:25.915
It seems to have taken a liking to me!

00:10:27.555 --> 00:10:30.115
You like animals don't
you, big brother?

00:10:30.495 --> 00:10:33.255
But mother didn't like
animals so we never got one.

00:10:33.865 --> 00:10:36.835
I wonder where it's from?
Can I get one?

00:10:37.565 --> 00:10:40.695
I don't remember dog
raising in "The World".

00:10:41.975 --> 00:10:44.135
I want one! I want one!

00:10:44.205 --> 00:10:45.105
You want one?

00:10:45.145 --> 00:10:46.265
Yes! I want one!

00:10:48.375 --> 00:10:52.145
You're the guy who saved us before.

00:10:52.245 --> 00:10:53.505
Lord Balmung!

00:10:53.945 --> 00:10:56.675
"Lord" Balmung?

00:11:00.255 --> 00:11:01.415
Kite.

00:11:01.895 --> 00:11:02.985
BlackRose.

00:11:05.895 --> 00:11:08.655
That's right! I've heard of this before!

00:11:09.265 --> 00:11:13.225
"Beneath the blooming
sakura are buried corpses".

00:11:13.805 --> 00:11:15.825
I haven't spotted any
conspicuous items nearby.

00:11:15.875 --> 00:11:16.965
So if I unearth a corpse...

00:11:17.175 --> 00:11:19.075
...the cherry blossoms will
bloom, there's no mistake!

00:11:20.005 --> 00:11:21.405
Character Campaign?

00:11:21.975 --> 00:11:24.035
Yeah! It was a splendid victory.

00:11:24.675 --> 00:11:25.615
I'm Rena.

00:11:26.515 --> 00:11:29.345
Kite is my older brother, Shugo!

00:11:29.885 --> 00:11:30.475
Hello.

00:11:31.415 --> 00:11:33.585
Rena. Shugo.

00:11:36.795 --> 00:11:37.885
That bracelet...

00:11:38.695 --> 00:11:42.595
I got it from a girl in white.

00:11:45.235 --> 00:11:46.205
It seems that...

00:11:46.435 --> 00:11:48.805
...there was a special event
attached to this character.

00:11:49.535 --> 00:11:53.565
She said, "Only you
can save this world."

00:11:59.745 --> 00:12:00.905
Aura?

00:12:04.715 --> 00:12:08.625
Found it! I was right!

00:12:09.455 --> 00:12:10.755
If I make the flowers bloom...

00:12:11.055 --> 00:12:13.525
...the rare item will be mine!

00:12:25.145 --> 00:12:27.605
No way! A Fighting Bones?

00:12:31.015 --> 00:12:34.775
Um, you've been quiet this entire time.

00:12:35.015 --> 00:12:37.345
Is something bothering you?

00:12:37.815 --> 00:12:40.985
Maybe you want this
bracelet for yourself?

00:12:41.055 --> 00:12:43.855
Shugo!
That was an insult to Lord Balmung.

00:12:43.955 --> 00:12:45.425
It was only a joke!

00:12:46.595 --> 00:12:48.285
If only it were.

00:12:51.395 --> 00:12:53.925
Um... Lord Balmung?

00:12:54.535 --> 00:12:56.125
It's a little late, but...

00:12:56.775 --> 00:12:57.735
Hm?

00:12:59.305 --> 00:13:04.045
That dangerous spot the
other day... saving me...

00:13:05.785 --> 00:13:07.705
Eh?

00:13:19.095 --> 00:13:20.685
No way!

00:13:21.995 --> 00:13:23.125
Hey!

00:13:28.505 --> 00:13:29.735
Mireille?

00:13:30.805 --> 00:13:31.465
What's wrong?

00:13:41.045 --> 00:13:44.845
Shugo! Why is a Fighting Bones here?

00:13:45.185 --> 00:13:46.775
Is it part of the event?

00:13:47.285 --> 00:13:48.445
This is insane!

00:13:48.555 --> 00:13:50.715
I didn't put monsters in this event!

00:13:51.625 --> 00:13:52.785
Lord Balmung!

00:13:52.995 --> 00:13:54.255
Reki? Did you?

00:13:54.695 --> 00:13:56.025
It's not me!

00:13:56.095 --> 00:13:57.655
I don't have that kind of time!

00:13:58.665 --> 00:14:00.135
Are they strong?

00:14:00.235 --> 00:14:01.895
Insanely strong!

00:14:01.975 --> 00:14:03.525
If they put one here...

00:14:03.805 --> 00:14:06.205
...there'd be no way
for a newbie to enter.

00:14:18.185 --> 00:14:20.485
Vak Revolver!

00:14:28.595 --> 00:14:28.925
What?

00:14:29.435 --> 00:14:29.955
No way!

00:14:30.265 --> 00:14:31.255
It's revived!

00:14:31.635 --> 00:14:33.195
Reki! It's dangerous here!

00:14:33.505 --> 00:14:35.405
Evacuate the player
characters in this area!

00:14:35.775 --> 00:14:39.265
Yes. You should all leave quickly.

00:14:41.445 --> 00:14:42.105
Eh?!

00:14:44.315 --> 00:14:45.715
What is going on?!

00:14:52.255 --> 00:14:52.875
Rena!

00:14:53.185 --> 00:14:54.515
Shugo!

00:14:56.355 --> 00:14:56.985
Rena!

00:14:58.395 --> 00:14:59.485
Shugo!

00:15:00.225 --> 00:15:01.425
Rena!

00:15:01.725 --> 00:15:04.395
Data... Drain!

00:15:25.525 --> 00:15:27.045
Why can't I move my sword?

00:15:27.455 --> 00:15:30.425
Is the Data Drain affecting us as well?

00:15:30.925 --> 00:15:32.115
This is revenge for earlier!

00:15:32.195 --> 00:15:35.525
Vak Dom! Vak Dom! Vak Dom!

00:15:35.635 --> 00:15:38.655
Why won't my spells work?

00:15:39.165 --> 00:15:41.565
Rena. Hey, are you all right?

00:15:43.675 --> 00:15:47.765
Shugo. Shugo...

00:15:48.245 --> 00:15:49.435
I love you!

00:15:55.255 --> 00:15:57.875
H-Hey Rena, what's wrong?

00:15:59.085 --> 00:16:01.315
I really love you, Shugo!

00:16:02.725 --> 00:16:07.025
R-Rena. Even if you say such a thing...

00:16:07.425 --> 00:16:08.555
Shugo!

00:16:12.165 --> 00:16:13.895
Leave the rest to me Shugo!

00:16:15.775 --> 00:16:16.995
That voice just now.

00:16:29.615 --> 00:16:31.245
My first transformation.

00:16:31.515 --> 00:16:33.645
Well, that just blew it.

00:16:34.755 --> 00:16:36.915
Ohka! It's Miss Ohka!

00:16:37.295 --> 00:16:38.295
An aquaintance of yours?

00:16:38.295 --> 00:16:40.155
Yup! Divine Fist Ohka!

00:16:40.295 --> 00:16:41.595
One of the most famous...

00:16:41.935 --> 00:16:44.195
...melee fighters in "The World"!

00:16:44.495 --> 00:16:46.555
She's REALLY strong!

00:16:51.075 --> 00:16:53.665
Shugo, you're wrong about one thing.

00:16:53.845 --> 00:16:54.705
Eh?

00:16:59.885 --> 00:17:01.075
How brittle...

00:17:01.115 --> 00:17:02.915
...you must have a calcium deficiency.

00:17:04.885 --> 00:17:07.325
I'm not a dog, I'm a wolf.

00:17:09.425 --> 00:17:11.325
A werewolf.

00:17:12.295 --> 00:17:13.415
Were-wolf?

00:17:14.395 --> 00:17:15.625
I'm not through with you yet!

00:17:27.975 --> 00:17:29.505
Divine Fist Ohka.

00:17:30.175 --> 00:17:33.045
She lives up to her reputation as one
of the most powerful melee fighters.

00:17:33.045 --> 00:17:33.775
She's strong.

00:17:44.695 --> 00:17:46.855
She truly is Divine Fist Ohka!

00:17:52.105 --> 00:17:54.435
The effects of the Data
Drain have worn off.

00:17:55.535 --> 00:17:57.765
What was I doing?

00:17:58.475 --> 00:18:00.635
Rena? Are you all right?

00:18:02.575 --> 00:18:04.105
Put me down, Shugo!

00:18:04.175 --> 00:18:06.735
I'll put you down but
you're the one that...

00:18:07.085 --> 00:18:11.785
Well, strange things certainly
happen around Shugo.

00:18:12.055 --> 00:18:14.025
Only with a Limited Edition!

00:18:21.495 --> 00:18:22.925
Mirelle! Look up!

00:18:23.235 --> 00:18:24.325
It can't be!

00:18:24.465 --> 00:18:26.725
Your spells from earlier
are finally going off.

00:18:37.545 --> 00:18:39.535
Ah! The cherry trees!

00:18:44.215 --> 00:18:45.275
That's it!

00:18:50.195 --> 00:18:52.255
"The Old Man Who Made
the Flowers Bloom"!

00:18:52.495 --> 00:18:53.895
The Old Man Who Made
the Flowers Bloom?

00:18:54.025 --> 00:18:56.465
Yeah! Upon the withered trees...

00:18:56.895 --> 00:18:58.335
Let's make the flowers bloom!

00:19:03.935 --> 00:19:05.265
That's correct.

00:19:06.045 --> 00:19:07.665
All right then!

00:19:08.605 --> 00:19:10.335
Juk Rom!

00:19:31.395 --> 00:19:33.235
Wow!

00:19:43.715 --> 00:19:46.575
Why did the Fighting Bones appear?

00:19:47.015 --> 00:19:49.645
Was it data corruption?

00:19:51.915 --> 00:19:54.285
Too many things worry me.

00:19:57.225 --> 00:20:01.855
But... for the moment...

00:20:02.265 --> 00:20:04.455
...let us enjoy the flower blossoms.

00:20:05.435 --> 00:20:08.595
Found it! We got the rare item!

00:20:10.705 --> 00:20:13.465
Shugo was the one that
cleared today's event.

00:20:13.675 --> 00:20:14.745
It's Shugo's.

00:20:14.745 --> 00:20:17.005
Rare item!!!

00:20:17.875 --> 00:20:19.675
What is it?! What? What?

00:20:23.685 --> 00:20:24.845
This...

00:20:26.855 --> 00:20:28.845
It looks like a collar.

00:20:29.055 --> 00:20:30.615
Why this?

00:20:32.765 --> 00:20:34.695
The Old Man Who
Made Flowers Bloom.

00:20:35.495 --> 00:20:37.225
He had a dog.

00:20:37.735 --> 00:20:39.725
So this must be its collar!

00:20:40.105 --> 00:20:41.935
Are you mocking me?

00:20:42.105 --> 00:20:44.195
What am I going to do with this?

00:20:44.475 --> 00:20:47.275
You can't raise dogs in
"The World" can you?

00:20:47.805 --> 00:20:51.075
Then, you can put it on me.

00:20:52.545 --> 00:20:55.815
I don't mind.

00:20:55.955 --> 00:20:59.475
Ah, no that's alright.

00:20:59.585 --> 00:21:03.285
Oh no! I have to
make dinner! Let's go!

00:21:04.025 --> 00:21:06.785
She really likes making dinner.

00:21:07.065 --> 00:21:09.085
This necklace will become
a family heirloom.

00:21:09.435 --> 00:21:11.665
If you ever need me, give me a call.

00:21:50.375 --> 00:21:50.935
Preview

00:21:50.935 --> 00:21:52.945
Preview
I've got information on items!

00:21:52.945 --> 00:21:55.545
Preview
If you go to the area
"Blazing Purgatory Valley"...

00:21:55.545 --> 00:21:57.945
Preview
...you can supposedly get a
hold of a Phoenix Feather.

00:21:58.115 --> 00:22:00.415
Shugo, this time we'll be alone.

00:22:00.615 --> 00:22:02.135
Who is that?!

00:22:02.385 --> 00:22:05.215
The Phoenix Feather

00:22:06.855 --> 00:22:17.285
Hashitteyuku kodomotachi
no hashagu warai koe ni
In the running
children's frolicking voices

00:22:17.665 --> 00:22:25.195
Hikari to kage oikakete mitaku naru
They want to chase
the light and shadows

00:22:28.475 --> 00:22:38.945
Midori no ha ni sukashite
mita ano taiyou no saki ni
Watching the sun shine
between the green leaves,

00:22:39.255 --> 00:22:48.025
Nani ga aru to omotteita no darou
wondering if something is there.

00:22:49.365 --> 00:22:59.565
Emerald Green hana wo
tsunda te no naka kara
From inside the picking hands,
the emerald green flowers

00:23:00.005 --> 00:23:10.475
Sora kaze tsuchi e to
sugata wo kaeteyuku
change their body to the
sky, the wind, the ground.

00:23:10.785 --> 00:23:22.685
Sono utsukushisa ni me wo hiraita
mabayushi sugiru basho de
Laying in that opulent place that
opened my eyes to its beauty,

00:23:23.035 --> 00:23:30.635
Nekoronda sora ni toikaketeru
Asking questions to the sky
